entry.summary:
Introduction


In the realm of mobile app development, React Native has emerged as a game-changer, offering developers a powerful tool to create high-performance applications for both iOS and Android platforms. Let's delve into the world of React Native and explore its key features and benefits.
React Native is an open-source framework developed by Facebook that allows developers to build mobile applications using JavaScript and React. It enables the creation of cross-platform apps with a single codebase, reducing development time and effort.
import React from 'react';
import { Text, View } from 'react-native';

const App = () => {
  return (
    <View>
      <Text>Hello, React Native!</Text>
    </View>
  );
};

export default App;

Hot Reloading: Developers can instantly see the changes …
